{
  "global_tier": {
    "comment": "Global Advanced/Elite split derived from 9 mapped TFOs/patrols. Space HP is a property of the ship class, not of the map or faction: for the same entity Elite is ~4.4x Advanced (median 4.44x, quartiles 4.20-4.61 over 45 entity pairs). Each threshold is the geometric mean between the highest observed Advanced and the lowest observed Elite of that class, so it sits ~2.1x above a typical Advanced. Ground maps scale ~1.54x instead and are excluded. Match order matters: Battlecruiser must be tested before Cruiser.",
    "exclude": [
      "Device_",
      "Photonic_Fleet",
      "Player_",
      "Distress",
      "Assistance_Beacon",
      "_Pet",
      "Drone",
      "Torpedo",
      "Probe",
      "Projectile",
      "Platform",
      "Turret",
      "Barrage",
      "Shuttle",
      "Fodder",
      "Stationmod",
      "Critter",
      "Wing",
      "Squadron",
      "Mine_",
      "Portal",
      "Gateway",
      "Ground",
      "Crewman",
      "Bluegills",
      "Boss",
      "Queen"
    ],
    "classes": [
      {
        "match": "Elachi_Battleship",
        "normal_threshold": 419000,
        "threshold": 1323000
      },
      {
        "match": "Elachi_Escort",
        "normal_threshold": 339000,
        "threshold": 1058000
      },
      {
        "match": "Elachi_Frigate",
        "normal_threshold": 91000,
        "threshold": 239000
      },
      {
        "match": "Dreadnought",
        "normal_threshold": 1200000,
        "threshold": 4000000
      },
      {
        "match": "Battlecruiser",
        "normal_threshold": 195000,
        "threshold": 650000
      },
      {
        "match": "Battleship",
        "normal_threshold": 260000,
        "threshold": 850000
      },
      {
        "match": "Cruiser",
        "normal_threshold": 188000,
        "threshold": 640000
      },
      {
        "match": "Escort",
        "normal_threshold": 145000,
        "threshold": 670000
      },
      {
        "match": "Frigate",
        "normal_threshold": 76000,
        "threshold": 264000
      },
      {
        "match": "Raider",
        "normal_threshold": 83000,
        "threshold": 250000
      }
    ],
    "comment_normal": "EXPERIMENTAL Normal band. Derived from a single Normal map (Defense of Starbase One), so it rests on far less data than the Advanced/Elite split: measured for Battleship (n=10), Cruiser (n=5), Raider (n=5), Frigate (n=2); Dreadnought, Battlecruiser and Escort are extrapolated at 0.30x the Elite threshold (the median ratio of the measured ones). Advanced/Normal is only ~1.6x apart versus ~4.4x for Elite/Advanced, so the margins are thin - Cruiser is the tightest (188k against a lowest observed Advanced of 194k). Expect false Normal readings here before anywhere else.",
    "comment_factions": "Faction-specific bands come FIRST because the list is matched in order. HP varies by faction within a class by up to 2.3x (Battleship: Elachi 609k down to Tholian 301k on Advanced), which is as large as the whole Normal->Advanced step of ~1.6x - so a single per-class Normal band overlapped. Elachi are the worst offender (Escort 486k vs 206-212k for Klingon/Nausicaan) and get their own bands; that lifts the Escort Normal/Advanced margin from an overlap to x1.96 and Battleship from x1.03 to x1.34. Add more factions here the same way if they misread."
  },
